+
+## Player portal
+
+The account application lives separately in `omoba-web`; the game workspace contains
+its `account-api/` service. Set `OMOBA_PLAYER_PORTAL_URL` to the verified public HTTPS
+portal URL and rebuild this landing to show the Player portal navigation link.
+Leave it unset before publication; local/private URLs are rejected. The landing
+does not handle game keys, browser sessions or database access.
